  "summary": "Checksum database bypass for golang.org/toolchain in cmd/go",
  "details": "Previously, a user operating inside of a malicious Go project that defines a bogus golang.org/toolchain go.sum entry and operates a malicious GOMODPROXY the user chooses to use can bypass the intended checksum.\n\nWe now ensure that golang.org/toolchain always goes to the network for the canonical checksum.",
